                  "\"Expansion adding colony tiles, player colonies, and trade fleets\"\nCLASS ColoniesExpansion : Module {\n  TradeAction<Action1>: 9 Owed<> THEN Billing<Class<TradeAction>, Action1>\n  TradeAction<Action2>: 3 Owed<Class<Energy>> THEN Billing<Class<TradeAction>, Action2, Class<Energy>>\n  TradeAction<Action3>: 3 Owed<Class<Titanium>> THEN Billing<Class<TradeAction>, Action3, Class<Titanium>>\n  This: BuildColonyProject\n  HAS Class<TradeAction>, Class<Action3>\n  -Billing<Class<TradeAction>>: Trade\n  SetupPhase: EACH Me@Player { TradeFleet }\n  SetupPhase IF SoloMode, SelectedColonyTile: EACH Me@Player { SoloColoniesSetup }\n  SetupPhase IF SoloMode: PROD[-2 MC<Player>]\n  SolarPhase: AdvanceColonyTracks\n}\n\n\"A colony tile, such as Pluto\"\nABSTRACT CLASS ColonyTile : Content, System, Iconic {\n  HAS MAX 1 This, MAX 3 Colony<This>, MAX 1 Trade<This>\n\n  This: ColonyProduction<This>\n  Colony<This>: ColonyProduction<This> / Colony<This, Anyone> - ColonyProduction<This>\n  ResetColonyProduction<This>: -ColonyProduction<This>* / ColonyProduction<This> - Colony<This, Anyone>\n  AdvanceColonyTracks: ColonyProduction<This>*\n  FinishTrade<This>: ResetColonyProduction<This>\n}\n\nCLASS Callisto : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Callisto>> {\n  Colony<This>: PROD[Energy]\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: 3 Energy\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Energy\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Energy\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 5 Energy\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 7 Energy\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 10 Energy\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 13 Energy\n}\n\nCLASS Ceres : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Ceres>> {\n  Colony<This>: PROD[Steel]\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: 2 Steel\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 6 Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 8 Steel\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 10 Steel\n}\n\nCLASS Enceladus : ColonyTile {\n  Colony<This>: 3 Microbe\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: Microbe\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: Microbe\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Microbe\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Microbe\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Microbe\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Microbe\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 5 Microbe\n}\n\nCLASS Europa : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Europa>> {\n  Colony<This>: OceanTile<>\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: 1 MC\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[1 MC]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[1 MC]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[Energy]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[Energy]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[Plant]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[Plant]\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: PROD[Plant]\n}\n\nCLASS Ganymede : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Ganymede>> {\n  Colony<This>: PROD[Plant]\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: Plant\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: Plant\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Plant\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Plant\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Plant\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 5 Plant\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 6 Plant\n}\n\nCLASS Io : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Io>> {\n  Colony<This>: PROD[Heat]\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: 2 Heat\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 6 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 8 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 10 Heat\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 13 Heat\n}\n\nCLASS Luna : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Luna>> {\n  Colony<This>: PROD[2 MC]\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: 2 MC\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: 1 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 7 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 10 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 13 MC\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 17 MC\n}\n\nCLASS Miranda : ColonyTile {\n  Colony<This>: Animal\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: ProjectCard\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: Animal\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: Animal\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Animal\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Animal\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Animal\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Animal\n}\n\nCLASS Pluto : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Pluto>> {\n  Colony<This>: 2 ProjectCard\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: PlutoLock! THEN ProjectCard THEN -ProjectCard THEN -PlutoLock!\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: ProjectCard\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 ProjectCard\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 ProjectCard\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 ProjectCard\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 ProjectCard\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 ProjectCard\n}\n\nCLASS PlutoLock : Owned<Player>, System { HAS MAX 1 This }\n\nCLASS Titan : ColonyTile {\n  Colony<This>: 3 Floater\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: Floater\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: Floater\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: Floater\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Floater\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Floater\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Floater\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Floater\n}\n\nCLASS Triton : ColonyTile, ColonyTileSelection<Class<Triton>> {\n  Colony<This>: 3 Titanium\n  GainColonyBonus<This>: Titanium\n\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =0 ColonyProduction<This>: Ok\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =1 ColonyProduction<This>: Titanium\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =2 ColonyProduction<This>: Titanium\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =3 ColonyProduction<This>: 2 Titanium\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =4 ColonyProduction<This>: 3 Titanium\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =5 ColonyProduction<This>: 4 Titanium\n  FinishTrade<This> IF =6 ColonyProduction<This>: 5 Titanium\n}\n\n\"One of the up-to-three colonies players can own on a ColonyTile\"\nCLASS Colony<@ColonyTile> : Owned<Player>, Iconic {\n  DEFAULT +Colony<ColonyTile(HAS MAX 0 Colony)>\n  FinishTrade<Anyone, @ColonyTile> OR GainColonyBonuses: GainColonyBonus<@ColonyTile>\n}\n\n\"A player's persistent capacity to conduct one Trade per generation\"\nCLASS TradeFleet : Owned<Player>, Iconic\n\n\"A trade with one colony tile, retained until the next generation\"\nCLASS Trade<@ColonyTile, GenerationScope> : Owned<Player>, Iconic {\n  This:: MAX 0 (Trade - TradeFleet): Ok\n  This: LATER { FinishTrade<@ColonyTile> }\n}\n\n\"The owner-attributed event that begins a Trade's completion consequences\"\nCLASS FinishTrade<ColonyTile> : Owned<Player>, Signal, System\n\n\"Trade with a colony tile\"\nCLASS TradeAction<ActionSlot> : StandardAction {\n  DEFAULT TradeAction<Action1>\n}\n\nCLASS BuildColonyProject : StandardProject {\n  cost = 17\n  1 MC / cost -> Colony<",
                  ">\n}\n\n\"A selected colony tile, whether it is already in play or waiting for a compatible card\"\nABSTRACT CLASS ColonyTileSelection<Class<ColonyTile>> { HAS MAX 1 This }\n\n\"A colony selected by the premise but not realized until setup is complete\"\nABSTRACT CLASS SelectedColonyTile<Class<@ColonyTile>> {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  CorporationPhase: ColonyTileSelection<Class<@ColonyTile>> FROM This\n}\n\nCLASS SelectedCallisto : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Callisto>>\nCLASS SelectedCeres : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Ceres>>\nCLASS SelectedEnceladus : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Enceladus>>\nCLASS SelectedEuropa : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Europa>>\nCLASS SelectedGanymede : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Ganymede>>\nCLASS SelectedIo : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Io>>\nCLASS SelectedLuna : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Luna>>\nCLASS SelectedMiranda : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Miranda>>\nCLASS SelectedPluto : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Pluto>>\nCLASS SelectedTitan : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Titan>>\nCLASS SelectedTriton : SelectedColonyTile<Class<Triton>>\n\n\"Lets the solo player discard one selected colony tile; owned so that player makes the choice\"\nCLASS SoloColoniesSetup : Owned<Player>, System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  This: -SelectedColonyTile THEN -This\n}\n\n\"A notch on the production track of a ColonyTile; note a tile has 0 to 6 of these (not 1 to 7)\"\nCLASS ColonyProduction<ColonyTile> : System, Iconic {\n  HAS MAX 6 This\n}\n\n\"An implementation detail used to trigger colony bonuses to be paid out\"\nCLASS GainColonyBonus<ColonyTile> : Owned<Player>, Signal, Atomized, System\n\n\"Advances every colony tile track one step during colony production\"\nCLASS AdvanceColonyTracks : Signal, System\n\n\"Requests one colony bonus payment for each colony the player owns\"\nCLASS GainColonyBonuses : Owned<Player>, Signal, System\n\n\"An implementation detail used to trigger a colony tile's 'white cube' to move left\"\nCLASS ResetColonyProduction<ColonyTile> : Signal, System\n\nABSTRACT CLASS DelayedColonyTile<Class<@ColonyTile>, Class<CardResource>> : ColonyTileSelection<Class<@ColonyTile>>\n\nCLASS DelayedEnceladus : DelayedColonyTile<Class<Enceladus>, Class<Microbe>> {\n  This IF ResourceCard<Class<Microbe>>: Enceladus FROM This\n  ResourceCard<Class<Microbe>>: Enceladus FROM This\n}\n\nCLASS DelayedMiranda : DelayedColonyTile<Class<Miranda>, Class<Animal>> {\n  This IF ResourceCard<Class<Animal>>: Miranda FROM This\n  ResourceCard<Class<Animal>>: Miranda FROM This\n}\n\nCLASS DelayedTitan : DelayedColonyTile<Class<Titan>, Class<Floater>> {\n  This IF ResourceCard<Class<Floater>>: Titan FROM This\n  ResourceCard<Class<Floater>>: Titan FROM This\n}\n",
